                                <td><code>TypeReferences</code> | <code>TypeNames</code> | <code>None</code></td>
                                <td><code>TypeReferences</code> wherever a switch is on, else <code>None</code>; not used where the publish is trimmed</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
