                <BitText Element="p">
                    And at runtime: <code>AddBitBlazorUIServices(options => ...)</code> with <code>LazyScripts</code>,
                    <code>ContentPath</code> and <code>TrySingleton</code>, and <code>BitBlazorUIScripts</code> with
                    <code>UseLazyScripts(contentPath)</code>, <code>UseBundledScripts()</code>,
                    <code>LazyScriptsEnabled</code> and <code>ContentPath</code>.
                </BitText>
            </DocSection>

